What is HFO-1234yf?
HFO-1234yf is a fourth-generation hydrofluoroolefin (HFO) refrigerant engineered as a sustainable, next-generation replacement for R134a. This innovative substance is characterized by an ultra-low global warming potential (GWP) of less than 1 and zero ozone depletion potential (ODP), making it fully compliant with the world's most rigorous environmental mandates, including the EU Mobile Air Conditioning Directive and the U.S. EPA's SNAP program. Its thermodynamic properties allow it to function as a near-drop-in solution in existing R134a automotive air conditioning systems, a feature that has been critical for its rapid adoption.
